    "issue_alignment": "CWE-416 use-after-free. In vips_foreign_load_matrix_load() the per-row buffer 'line' is freed (g_free) before vips_error() formats the 'bad number' message from pointer 'p' which points into that buffer. The upstream fix (commit 175408733fcffed7aa0618c6d5ad5390ed5c4f88 'fix use-after-free', oss-fuzz testcase 5663684670259200) moves g_free(line) after the vips_error() call. PoC is a matrix text file with a valid 'width height scale offset' header and a data row containing a token with no digit, which makes vips_strtod() fail."
